00:02:07.761 --> 00:02:11.732 size:53% position:73% line:53%
1500 soldats en uniforme,

00:02:08.996 --> 00:02:13.267 size:53% position:73% line:53%
300 chevaux ont défilé pour

00:02:10.531 --> 00:02:14.768 size:53% position:73% line:53%
cette cérémonie baptisée

00:02:12.233 --> 00:02:16.804 size:53% position:73% line:53%
"Troopinur".

00:02:13.601 --> 00:02:18.806 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 La reine salue ses sujets,

00:02:15.102 --> 00:02:20.341 size:53% position:73% line:53%
entourée de toute la famille

00:02:17.137 --> 00:02:23.811 size:53% position:73% line:53%
royale. Un ensemble vert pomme

00:02:19.139 --> 00:02:25.312 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour bien marquer l'occasion.

00:02:20.674 --> 00:02:26.847 size:53% position:73% line:53%
(coup de canon)

00:02:24.311 --> 00:02:28.649 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Plus dede canons sont

00:02:25.646 --> 00:02:31.919 size:53% position:73% line:53%
tirés de la Tour de Londres,

00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:33.454 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour rendre hommage à son règne.

00:02:28.983 --> 00:02:34.955 size:53% position:73% line:53%
♪ ♪ ♪

00:02:32.253 --> 00:02:36.490 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Le 9 avril 2021, elle perd

00:02:33.787 --> 00:02:38.025 size:53% position:73% line:53%
son compagnon de toujours,

00:02:35.289 --> 00:02:39.526 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le prince Philippe, qui a été

00:02:36.824 --> 00:02:41.061 size:53% position:73% line:53%
